  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Measure the rendered profile-fragment length from real profiles; choose the new EnvelopeBudget.User value.</step>
    <step order="2">Make the render byte-stable (ordinal multi-selects, canonical prefs JSON); update ContextEnvelopeRendererTests.</step>
    <step order="3">Change the constant; re-baseline the golden-utterance gate + eval prompt-cache prefix; record the code-review sign-off note (Path B).</step>
    <step order="4">Decide caching (cite or reject IdentityNormalizationService Redis 10-min TTL) + a latency budget; implement soft-fail-to-null.</step>
    <step order="5">Build + publish-size; run the eval baseline green. Update TASK-INDEX.md 032 → ✅.</step>
